25. Subject-Wise Attendance

Attendance must be calculated independently for each subject.

Example:

Subject| Attendance| Alert
DBMS| 88%| No
OOP| 72%| Yes
Mathematics| 91%| No
Networks| 68%| Yes

The system should not calculate a simple average of subject percentages.

Attendance should be calculated from the actual class records for each subject.

---

26. Different Weekly Frequencies

Subjects can have different weekly frequencies.

Example:

Subject| Classes / Week
Mathematics| 5
DBMS| 4
OOP| 4
Networks| 3
Communication| 2
Laboratory| 2

The calculation must be based on:

Actual classes conducted
+
Actual classes attended

rather than assuming a fixed weekly frequency.

