30. Database Validation Rules

The backend should enforce:

classes_attended >= 0
classes_conducted >= 0
classes_attended <= classes_conducted

The system should not blindly trust a stored percentage.

Instead:

attendance_percentage =
(classes_attended / classes_conducted) × 100

Handle:

classes_conducted = 0

to avoid division-by-zero errors.

